flowchart TD
    subgraph RAW[Raw Data]
      R1[High-Res Satellite Imagery<br/>1m GSD, 3-band RGB]
      R2[OSM Southern India Export<br/>Buildings, Roads, Water, Landuse]
      R3[Google Open Buildings<br/>ML-detected footprints]
    end
    R2 --> Q1
    R3 --> Q1
    subgraph QGIS[QGIS Processing]
      Q1[Vector Merging<br/>OSM + Google] --> Q2[CRS Reprojection / Alignment]
      Q2 --> Q3[Class Definition<br/>8-class schema] --> Q4[Rasterization to GeoTIFF masks]
    end
    R1 --> C1
    Q4 --> C1
    subgraph CHIP[Chipping & Pairing]
      C1[Image Chipping 512x512] --> C2[Image-Mask Pairing & Co-registration]
    end
    C2 --> CL
    subgraph CLEAN[Cleaning & Balancing]
      CL[CRS consistency check] --> CL2[Corrupt tile removal]
      CL2 --> CL3[No-Data filter: drop >80% background] --> CL4[Class balance audit]
    end
    CL4 --> F[Final Dataset<br/>18,240 chips · 5 districts · 5-class taxonomy]
